Aus #98. Ein cancelled-Branch wird in Raid::Parallel ins Endergebnis gefaltet als Branch ohne Text, statt das cancelled-Result weiterzugeben (vgl. Raid::Sequential / ADR 0009).

2026-09-29 17:51 Cause: Parallel.pm winner selection only checked abort/question/pause; a cancelled branch fell through to the final text join. Fix: cancelled joins the winner chain, ranked abort > cancelled > question > pause (an abort is an error that must not be masked; a question/pause after cancellation would invite resuming a run the user stopped). Sequential/Loop already propagate any non-final; regression tests for all three in t/96_raid_orchestration.t.

2026-09-29 17:51 Done: Raid::Parallel propagates a cancelled branch (abort > cancelled > question > pause), POD aggregation list updated. Regression tests in t/96_raid_orchestration.t (Parallel cancelled + priority vs abort/question/pause; Sequential/Loop cancelled propagation). Red before fix, green after: prove -I dev langertha t/96_raid_orchestration.t.

